Believe it or not, blessed smoky potions are a way to snag several easy
wishes a game, especially if the smoky potion for your game happens to be
really common, like, say, healing :)  Just grab as many as you can, and bless
and quaff them, and if you're persistent, you'll snag a wish or two.  A
few games ago, smoky potions were healing potions, and I literally had 
a dozen djinni jumping out of bottles from monsters trying to heal themselves
as I pounded them :)

Thrones, sometimes, will yield a wish.  And about your water demons-- the
earlier in the dungeon you get a demon from a fountain, the more likely
it is the demon will give you a wish (at least, this was true for 3.0j, 
have yet to confirm it for 3.1.3).

